<h3>Your moving checklist</h3>
<p class="sub np">Two taps: how long until you move, and whether you rent or own. Your checklist appears below. Tick tasks as you go, then print it.</p>
<fieldset class="np"><legend>1. When do you move?</legend>
<div class="opts hts" role="group" aria-label="Time until moving day">
<button type="button" data-t="8" class="on"><b>8+ weeks</b><span>plenty of time</span></button>
<button type="button" data-t="6"><b>6 weeks</b><span>on track</span></button>
<button type="button" data-t="4"><b>4 weeks</b><span>a month</span></button>
<button type="button" data-t="2"><b>2 weeks</b><span>soon</span></button>
<button type="button" data-t="1"><b>This week</b><span>last minute</span></button>
</div>
</fieldset>
<fieldset class="np"><legend>2. Your current home</legend>
<div class="opts" role="group" aria-label="Home">
<button type="button" data-h="r" class="on"><b>Renting</b><span>moving out of a rental</span></button>
<button type="button" data-h="o"><b>I own it</b><span>selling or moving out</span></button>
</div>
</fieldset>
<details class="more np"><summary>More options: moving date, kids, pets, country, movers</summary>
<div class="grid">
<label><span>Moving date (adds a date to every step)</span><input type="date" id="md"></label>
<label><span>How you are moving</span><select id="mv"><option value="m" selected>Hiring movers</option><option value="v">Renting a van or truck</option><option value="v2">Friends and our own car</option></select></label>
</div>
<div class="ck"><label><input type="checkbox" id="ok"> Kids</label><label><input type="checkbox" id="op"> Pets</label><label><input type="checkbox" id="of"> Long distance</label></div>
<div class="row"><span class="hint" style="margin:0">Country:</span><div class="seg" role="group" aria-label="Country"><button type="button" data-c="us">US</button><button type="button" data-c="uk">UK</button><button type="button" data-c="ot">Other</button></div></div>
<p class="hint">Your ticks are saved in this browser only. Your choices are not, so set them again when you come back.</p>
</details>
<div class="res" aria-live="polite">
<div id="vv" class="verdict"></div>
<div class="prog"><div class="bar"><i id="pb"></i></div><span id="pt"></span></div>
<div id="ls"></div>
<div class="acts np"><button type="button" id="pr" class="pri">Print my checklist</button><a id="pdf" href="#" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Download the PDF</a><button type="button" id="cl">Clear ticks</button></div>
</div>

